## Highlights
► A novel conductive MOFs based composites with a core-shell structure was successfully designed.
$\blacktriangleright$ The resultant material (PMeTh) was used as an electrocatalyst for detection of L-dopa.
PMeTh has both the merits on active sites of PCN-222(Fe) and high charge collectability of P3MT.
The sensor can be extended to accurate detection of L-dopa in urine samples with high sensitivity and selectivity.
